&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to the Sr. Director, Total Rewards &amp;amp; People Operations and providing thought partnership and collaboration across the People organization and leveraging data driven insights that support the design of innovative, cost effective and market competitive programs to support SimpliSafers.&lt;/p&gt;
