&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and manage core compensation programs (salary, bonus) aligned to company strategy and guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with People Partners and business leaders on pay decisions, leveling, and employee-related compensation matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead key compensation cycles (merit, promotions, benchmarking) with a focus on accuracy, consistency, and experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply and evolve compensation frameworks using market data and internal insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and analysis to inform decisions, identify trends, and flag risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to broader Total Rewards initiatives as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the People Partners, People Operations and Payroll to support processes and projects across the employee lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
