&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS Degree in Business or Finance preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CBP or CCP preferred, but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 6-8 years of experience in compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with compensation administration, preferably with Workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work on problems of diverse scope where analysis of data requires evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong excel skills including formulas, functions, pivot tables etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to maintain total confidentiality in all matters related to employee compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-level organizational, project and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
