&lt;li&gt;Free SimpliSafe system and professional monitoring for your home.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups (ERGs) that bring people together, give opportunities to network, mentor and develop, and advocate for change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The target annual base pay range for this role is $80,000 to $105,000&lt;/p&gt;
