&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director of Tax is a key leadership role responsible for overseeing SimpliSafe’s global tax strategy, operations, and compliance. This leader will direct the development and execution of tax planning initiatives, ensure compliance with domestic and international tax laws, and safeguard the company’s tax position as the business continues to innovate and scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Tax Director will work closely with Finance, Accounting, Legal, Operations, and other cross-functional partners to support strategic decision-making. The ideal candidate brings deep technical expertise, strong strategic judgment, and the leadership capability to drive operational excellence, financial efficiency, and compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
