&lt;li&gt;Oversee the preparation and review of quarterly and annual income tax provisions in accordance with ASC 740&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;the accurate and timely preparation, review, and approval of global tax payments, corporate income tax returns, and related filings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee sales and use tax compliance, property tax, VAT, excise taxes, and other indirect tax obligations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead tax audits and examinations for direct and indirect taxes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on the tax implications of business activities, new products, entity structures, and strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with external tax advisors to supplement internal capabilities and ensure best-in-class support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee tax planning and projects, including transfer pricing, mergers and acquisitions, and tax-efficient financing strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively monitor evolving tax legislation and communicate potential impacts and opportunities to executive leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the processes for tax registrations and renewals working collaboratively with other internal compliance teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive automation and process improvement by leveraging technology to enable compliance and strategic tax insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop a high-performing team across both direct and indirect tax functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Accounting, Treasury, Legal, FP&amp;amp;A, HR, and other business stakeholders to support operational and strategic alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present tax updates, risks, and planning strategies to executive leadership and, when required, the Audit Committee&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
