&lt;h3&gt;About SimpliSafe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a high-tech home security company that&#39;s passionate about protecting the life you&#39;ve built and our mission of keeping Every Home Secure. And we&#39;ve created a culture here that cares just as deeply about the career you&#39;re building. Ours is a no ego culture of collaboration and innovation where those seeking their next challenge can find big opportunities and make a huge impact on the lives of all those who we protect. We don&#39;t just want you to work here. We want you to grow and thrive here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why are we hiring?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Well, we&#39;re growing and thriving. So, we need smart, talented, and humble people who share our values to join us as we disrupt the home security space and relentlessly pursue our mission of keeping Every Home Secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a role for someone who runs a single account in a silo. It&#39;s for a hands-on retail leader who owns relationships, owns the numbers, and owns the outcome — someone who can walk into a buyer meeting and drive a joint business plan, then walk into an internal review and defend the P&amp;amp;L behind it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is as much a build role as it is a run role. There’s real upside in this channel, and unlocking it will take a leader who’s willing to get into the details - sharpening the account strategy, tightening execution, and building the operating rhythm that gets us there - while also setting the multi-year direction. You’ll need to move fluidly between big-picture strategy and hands-on, in-the-weeds work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Retail, you will own SimpliSafe&#39;s retail channel: the partner relationships, the P&amp;amp;L, the account plans, and the strategic direction of where we take this channel next. You&#39;ll deepen and expand the relationships we already have across big-box, mass and club, and online retail — and you&#39;ll bring new products to market through those doors while driving sell-through and growing our share of the category. You&#39;ll set the marketing and promotional strategy that gets our products off the shelf and into homes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead a team of account managers and specialists and you&#39;ll partner closely with Product, Marketing, Finance, and Supply Chain to make retail a bigger, faster-growing engine for the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Own&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail accounts and relationships.&lt;/strong&gt; You own SimpliSafe&#39;s retail partnerships across big-box (e.g., Best Buy), mass and club (e.g., Costco, Walmart, Target), and online retail (e.g., Amazon). You&#39;ll be the senior relationship owner — building trust with buyers and merchandising teams, running joint business planning, and turning existing accounts into deeper, longer-term partnerships while opening up new ones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Channel P&amp;amp;L.&lt;/strong&gt; You own the retail P&amp;amp;L. You&#39;ll build and manage account plans against clear targets for revenue, margin, and share, and you&#39;ll be accountable for the numbers — knowing what&#39;s working, what isn&#39;t, and what the best next move is.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell-through and category share.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll drive sell-through at the shelf and grow SimpliSafe&#39;s share of the home security category. That means the right assortment, the right placement, the right price, and the right promotional support in every account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New product introductions.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll bring new products to market through the retail channel — partnering with Product and Marketing to land launches, secure distribution and shelf space, and set launches up to win from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing and promotional strategy.&lt;/strong&gt; You own the marketing and promotional strategy for the channel. You&#39;ll build promotional calendars in partnership with our retail accounts and internal Marketing team, plan and manage trade spend, and measure what actually moves the numbers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll lead, mentor, and grow a team of account managers, channel specialists, and analysts. You&#39;ll create an environment where accountability and transparency are the baseline, and where each person owns their accounts and their numbers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep retail expertise, with a track record of owning and growing retail accounts and channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling hardware or subscription services through retail channels — ideally in a considered-purchase or D2C-meets-retail environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Past P&amp;amp;L ownership, with strong command of retail economics (revenue, margin, trade spend, sell-in vs. sell-through, share).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong retail relationships and account management skills — someone buyers trust and want to plan with.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A firm grasp of promotional calendars and how to plan, fund, and measure promotional activity that drives sell-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing a team of account managers, specialists, and/or analysts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort building (and rebuilding) processes, account strategies, and team operating rhythms from the ground up - someone who can diagnose what isn’t working and isn’t afraid to change it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to flex seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution-from shaping channel direction to getting into the weeds of an account plan when needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using data to tell the story — how the channel is performing, what&#39;s driving it, and what to do next — whether 1:1, in a deck, or in front of leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love to work in a team environment. You love collaboration, co-creating, and different opinions; it&#39;s not about &quot;whose idea&quot; it was, it&#39;s about the right ideas, execution, and accountability for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Values You&#39;ll Share&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Obsessed&lt;/strong&gt; - Building deep empathy for our customers, putting them at the core of our work, and developing strong, long-term relationships with them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aim High&lt;/strong&gt; - Always challenging ourselves and others to raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Ego&lt;/strong&gt; - Maintaining a &quot;no job too small&quot; attitude, and an open, inclusive and humble style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One Team&lt;/strong&gt; - Taking a highly collaborative approach to achieving success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lift As We Climb&lt;/strong&gt; - Investing in developing others and helping others around us succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lean &amp;amp; Nimble&lt;/strong&gt; - Working with agility and efficiency to experiment in an often ambiguous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mission- and values-driven culture and a safe, inclusive environment where you can build, grow and thrive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A comprehensive total rewards package that supports your wellness and provides security for SimpliSafers and their families &lt;em&gt;(For more information on our total rewards please &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://simplisafe.gobenefits.net/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;click here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
