&lt;li&gt;Keep internal stakeholders informed through regular reporting, clear escalation frameworks, and proactive communication on vendor health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify operational risks across the vendor portfolio and come prepared with recommended solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of vendor management, partner management, or strategic sourcing experience, with demonstrated ownership of complex, high-stakes vendor relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in contact center BPO management or security industry wholesale/monitoring vendor management strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of vendor performance metrics and the ability to translate data into actionable strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation skills and comfort managing contract amendments, SLAs, and commercial terms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build credibility quickly with both internal technical teams and external vendor counterparts — becoming a true SME in the platforms and services you own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about and experience working with technology platforms; familiarity with monitoring operations, AI-enabled tools, or quality management systems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to present findings and recommendations clearly to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and self-directed, with the ability to manage multiple vendor relationships and priorities simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
