&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Retail Sales Forecasting &amp;amp; Planning Manager on the Sales Operations team to drive forecast This role sits side-by-side with our Retail account managers as their dedicated planning partner — jointly building promotional plans, forecasting units, and shaping account strategy for SimpliSafe&#39;s national retail accounts. You&#39;ll be the analytical engine behind each account manager, turning data into the plans they take to their retail partners, accuracy, sales performance reporting, and planning rigor across SimpliSafe’s national retail accounts. In this role you will sit at the intersection of data, strategy, and execution — translating complex business trends into clear plans that support the retail sales organization and executive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
