&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own sourcing strategy and execution across a broad portfolio of indirect categories including but not limited to marketing/GTM, technology, professional services, HR/people, and operations with real estate explicitly out of scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build deep partnerships with stakeholders across the business, aligning sourcing strategy with each function&#39;s priorities and SimpliSafe&#39;s broader goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, prioritize, and execute category strategies and procurement project pipelines with a focus on value creation (savings and cost avoidance), speed, innovation, and risk mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the team&#39;s go-to generalist across a wide range of categories, developing enough depth in each to be a credible advisor while knowing when to loop in specialist input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead RFx processes end-to-end, present negotiation outcomes, build business cases, and influence budget owners and senior leadership through data-driven recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion strategic procurement across the organization, driving adoption of best practices through influence rather than mandate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across the organization to streamline workflows, improve spend visibility, increase speed-to-market, and strengthen cross-functional execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flex quickly across categories as business priorities shift, reflecting our lean and nimble operating style.&lt;/li&gt;
